    <string name="ai_enable_needs_checks">Available once the connection and tool call checks pass</string>
    <string name="ai_enable_notice_title">Before turning on</string>
    <string name="ai_enable_notice">1. AI features send what you type or share to the address you set, where that service handles it. Valnook does not see it and cannot control how the service keeps or uses it.\n2. You and the service settle the costs.\n3. To keep the data on your own devices, point the address at a model on your own network.\n4. AI results can be wrong; nothing is saved until you confirm it.</string>
